  - clueId: L03_GlutinousRice_Ratio
    title: Glutinous Rice - Ratio Clue
    content: Glutinous rice is suited to support texture and smoothness, not to lead
      the aroma.
    relatedIngredients:
    - {fileID: 1989610468}
    relatedDimension: 2
